w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E34vm1Zv7oUQ7kNvwEgRXkT&_nc_oc=AdkXgI54SH28KFtxI_CpUdmSDKOlwMU-__Bt-q-Ua20E2fyBi3L6OPh539a__d9CHKY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyGbvgkD2GGT8ok04oFL1MXXN8Bu-m5NR3cwMps18AgLA&oe=69AEB5AA"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yL9JE1Z8vr4Q7kNvwFu3V9y&_nc_oc=Adl3OiV8fWRqLL6EJ92GXaz8nK_WoRzqs5NG70BvnHN0_5-G8GiOzX0st_aa0balRyg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwDge9QLFTmEdH4vND8cOz4nlRpfI2p5XyZsNrdiL_dog&oe=69AEC85E"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UvPmt1M6S8IQ7kNvwFvlR7D&_nc_oc=Adn0INI5ggw0y5KpSn-gOfCobSxf1HC7f4fn_FOhyHSW6_gHlTLaVbWIfqEawwFL6io&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwyiOBx_3BHWS9VJkSrgncIoSd6QC7QOyEXxuYHrlArWg&oe=69AEB731"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9